  <dart:CurrentFinancialGuaranteeLiabilities contextRef="CFY2026eHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_CarryingAmountAccumulatedDepreciationAmortisationAndImpairmentAndGrossCarryingAmountAxis_dart_ReportedAmountMember" unitRef="KRW" decimals="-3">1294826000</dart:CurrentFinancialGuaranteeLiabilities>
  <dart:CurrentFinancialGuaranteeLiabilities contextRef="PFY2025eHY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_CarryingAmountAccumulatedDepreciationAmortisationAndImpairmentAndGrossCarryingAmountAxis_dart_ReportedAmountMember" unitRef="KRW" decimals="-3">1749550000</dart:CurrentFinancialGuaranteeLiabilities>
  <dart:DescriptionOfCommitments contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_entity00413046_AgreementsRelatedToProductSupplyContractsMemberOfTypesOfCommitmentsDomainOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">연결기업은 해외 제약회사와 판매 및 유통권한을 부여하는 계약과 제품공급계약을 체결하고 있습니다. 이러한 계약 중 일부 업체와 인센티브, 매입할인, 가격정산 등의 영업활동을 지원하기 위한 약정사항이 존재하며, 이에 따라 수익, 관련 자산ㆍ부채가 변동될 수 있습니다.</dart:DescriptionOfCommitments>
  <dart:DescriptionOfCommitments contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_entity00413046_DiscountedTransferOfTradeReceivablesMemberOfTypesOfCommitmentsDomainOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">보고기간말 현재 연결기업은 일부 매출채권을 금융기관에 할인하여 양도할 수 있는 약정을 체결하고 있습니다.</dart:DescriptionOfCommitments>
  <dart:DescriptionOfCommitments contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_entity00413046_FillFinishAndOthersMemberOfTypesOfCommitmentsDomainOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">연결기업은 Fill &amp; Finish 등 용역계약 관련하여 최소 구매 수량에 대한 약정 사항이 존재하며, 해당 약정수량 미달 주문시 보상해주어야 할 의무가 존재하고 있습니다.</dart:DescriptionOfCommitments>
  <dart:DescriptionOfCommitments contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_entity00413046_JointResearchAndDevelopmentAgreementsMemberOfTypesOfCommitmentsDomainOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">연결기업은 다수의 기업과 공동연구개발 계약을 체결하여 후보물질 발굴 및 검증, 임상물질 생산 등의 연구개발 활동을 수행하고 있습니다. 연구 기간 및 연구 범위가 변경될 수 있으며, 연구 진행 과정에 따라 지급조건이 확정되는 구조로 되어 있습니다.</dart:DescriptionOfCommitments>
  <dart:DescriptionOfCommitments contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_ifrs-full_LoanCommitmentsMember_ifrs-full_CounterpartiesAxis_entity00413046_Citibank1MemberOfCounterpartiesDomainOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">일반운전자금대출</dart:DescriptionOfCommitments>
  <dart:DescriptionOfCommitments contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_ifrs-full_LoanCommitmentsMember_ifrs-full_CounterpartiesAxis_entity00413046_Citibank2MemberOfCounterpartiesDomainOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">무역금융</dart:DescriptionOfCommitments>
  <dart:DescriptionOfCommitments contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_ifrs-full_LoanCommitmentsMember_ifrs-full_CounterpartiesAxis_entity00413046_CitibankHungaryMemberOfCounterpartiesDomainOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">당좌대출</dart:DescriptionOfCommitments>
  <dart:DescriptionOfCommitments contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_ifrs-full_LoanCommitmentsMember_ifrs-full_CounterpartiesAxis_entity00413046_DeutscheBankMemberOfCounterpartiesDomainOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">무역금융은 전액 상환청구권이 있는 매출채권팩토링약정 대상 금액입니다(주석 6(4), 10 참조).</dart:DescriptionOfCommitments>
  <dart:DescriptionOfCommitments contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_ifrs-full_LoanCommitmentsMember_ifrs-full_CounterpartiesAxis_entity00413046_HsbcMemberOfCounterpartiesDomainOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">무역금융</dart:DescriptionOfCommitments>
  <dart:DescriptionOfCommitments contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_ifrs-full_LoanCommitmentsMember_ifrs-full_CounterpartiesAxis_entity00413046_InternationaleNederlandenGroepMemberOfCounterpartiesDomainOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">무역금융</dart:DescriptionOfCommitments>
  <dart:DescriptionOfCommitments contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_ifrs-full_LoanCommitmentsMember_ifrs-full_CounterpartiesAxis_entity00413046_Kdb1MemberOfCounterpartiesDomainOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">시설자금대출</dart:DescriptionOfCommitments>
  <dart:DescriptionOfCommitments contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_ifrs-full_LoanCommitmentsMember_ifrs-full_CounterpartiesAxis_entity00413046_Kdb2MemberOfCounterpartiesDomainOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">L/C USANCE는 전액 공급자금융약정 대상 금액입니다.</dart:DescriptionOfCommitments>
  <dart:DescriptionOfCommitments contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_ifrs-full_LoanCommitmentsMember_ifrs-full_CounterpartiesAxis_entity00413046_ShinhanBank1MemberOfCounterpartiesDomainOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">L/C USANCE는 전액 공급자금융약정 대상 금액입니다.</dart:DescriptionOfCommitments>
  <dart:DescriptionOfCommitments contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_ifrs-full_LoanCommitmentsMember_ifrs-full_CounterpartiesAxis_entity00413046_ShinhanBank2MemberOfCounterpartiesDomainOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">시설자금대출</dart:DescriptionOfCommitments>
  <dart:DescriptionOfCommitments contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_ifrs-full_LoanCommitmentsMember_ifrs-full_CounterpartiesAxis_entity00413046_ShinhanBank3MemberOfCounterpartiesDomainOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">무신용장방식(D/A)</dart:DescriptionOfCommitments>
  <dart:DescriptionOfCommitments contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_ifrs-full_LoanCommitmentsMember_ifrs-full_CounterpartiesAxis_entity00413046_UbsMemberOfCounterpartiesDomainOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">일반운전자금대출</dart:DescriptionOfCommitments>
  <dart:DescriptionOfCommitments contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_entity00413046_AgreementsRelatedToProductSupplyContractsMemberOfTypesOfCommitmentsDomainOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">당사는 해외 제약회사 및 종속기업과 판매 및 유통권한을 부여하는 계약과 제품공급계약을 체결하고 있습니다. 이러한 계약 중 일부 업체와 인센티브, 매입할인, 가격정산 등의 영업활동을 지원하기 위한 약정사항이 존재하며, 이에 따라 수익, 관련 자산ㆍ부채가 변동될 수 있습니다.</dart:DescriptionOfCommitments>
  <dart:DescriptionOfCommitments contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_entity00413046_DiscountedTransferOfTradeReceivablesMemberOfTypesOfCommitmentsDomainOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">보고기간말 현재 당사는 일부 매출채권을 금융기관에 할인하여 양도할 수 있는 약정을 체결하고 있습니다.</dart:DescriptionOfCommitments>
  <dart:DescriptionOfCommitments contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_entity00413046_ExclusiveDistributionAndSupplyAgreementMemberOfTypesOfCommitmentsDomainOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">당사는 거래구조 단순화를 통한 국내 판매 효율성 제고를 위해 2020년 7월 31일 종속기업인 셀트리온제약에게 계약제품을 국내에서 독점적으로 유통 및 판매할 수 있는 권한을 부여하는 유통공급계약을 체결하였습니다. 본 계약은 2024년 6월 30일부로 자동 갱신되어, 갱신된 계약기간은 2024년 6월 30일로부터 5년입니다.</dart:DescriptionOfCommitments>
  <dart:DescriptionOfCommitments contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_entity00413046_FillFinishAndOthersMemberOfTypesOfCommitmentsDomainOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">당사는 Fill &amp; Finish 등 용역계약 관련하여 최소 구매 수량에 대한 약정 사항이 존재하며, 해당 약정수량 미달 주문시 보상해주어야 할 의무가 존재하고 있습니다.</dart:DescriptionOfCommitments>
  <dart:DescriptionOfCommitments contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_entity00413046_JointResearchAndDevelopmentAgreementsMemberOfTypesOfCommitmentsDomainOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">당사는 다수의 기업과 공동연구개발 계약을 체결하여 후보물질 발굴 및 검증, 임상물질 생산 등의 연구개발 활동을 수행하고 있습니다. 연구 기간 및 연구 범위가 변경될 수 있으며, 연구 진행 과정에 따라 지급조건이 확정되는 구조로 되어 있습니다.</dart:DescriptionOfCommitments>
  <dart:DescriptionOfCommitments contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_ifrs-full_LoanCommitmentsMember_ifrs-full_CounterpartiesAxis_entity00413046_DeutscheBankMemberOfCounterpartiesDomainOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">(*2) 무역금융은 전액 상환청구권이 있는 매출채권팩토링약정 대상 금액입니다(주석 6(3), 10 참조).</dart:DescriptionOfCommitments>
  <dart:DescriptionOfCommitments contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_ifrs-full_LoanCommitmentsMember_ifrs-full_CounterpartiesAxis_entity00413046_Kdb1MemberOfCounterpartiesDomainOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">시설자금대출</dart:DescriptionOfCommitments>
